{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a familiar yet subtly wrong version of modern day Shibuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a routine morning commute quietly unravels. You awaken in your office after hours. Everyone is gone. The city lights outside feel distant, artificial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/One.gif?t=1750725308\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the 32nd floor, you must descend through echoing corridors, sealed elevators, and rooms that seem to rearrange themselves when you're not looking. Along the way, you\u2019ll gather fragments of a forgotten device, each \u201cshard\u201d unlocking strange messages and impossible truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/Three.gif?t=1750725308\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you navigating a glitch in space\u2026 or your own fractured memory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A surreal, hyper-realistic reimagining of Shibuya\u2019s corporate interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate from floor 32 to the street through immersive, detail-rich spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover shard fragments to decode a hidden AI language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric puzzles and spatial storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ambient soundscape that blurs the line between simulation and reality</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805820?t=1750725308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/22a58236d112324e635e8473d46c10eb7d9